    "body": "Pushed 49e33c12.\n1. Help test now driven from the subcommand list: `pub const HELP_LANES` in cli.rs pairs each lane with its usage text; `command_usage` reads it; the test iterates it and derives the flags per lane from the usage text's ARGUMENTS/OPTIONS blocks, and checks the output equals the lane's usage. New test `every_listed_command_is_a_help_lane` fails if a command in the top-level COMMANDS block has no lane.\nQuick gate green (cli, mcp, mcp_verify, regression_models, lib), clippy -D warnings clean.\n\nReady for a re-review.",
